cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use system-one in your work, please cite it."
title: "system-one: an open-source System One decision model"
authors:
  - family-names: Puig
    given-names: Marc
repository-code: "https://github.com/mpuig/system-one"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-09-22
abstract: >
  A learning project that rebuilds the behavior of Typesafe's Jev on small
  fine-tuned open models: calibrated typed decisions (choice/score/noul) via
  restricted-logit readout, trained and served locally on Apple MLX, with a
  frozen experimental protocol, grouped-bootstrap confidence intervals, and an
  audited decision log. The name is Kahneman's term for the fast, automatic judgment faculty.
